:"高木 奈緒","creatorId":"vndb:s25043","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s25043","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s25043","name":"高木奈緒","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:174952","source":"vndb"},{"creditedName":"Joru","creatorId":"vndb:s36538","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s36538","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s36538","name":"Joru","roleCode":"staff","roleLabel":"制作人员","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-staff:174953","source":"vndb"}]},"cast":[{"characterId":"char_c98081","characterName":"彩坂 桜","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"97677","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"336983"}],"egsCharacterIds":["23514"],"vndbCharacterId":"c98081"},"originalCharacterName":"彩坂 桜","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"214"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"E"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Watching pro baseball matches"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Stories with happy endings, ice cream, baseball"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Stories with sad endings, when her friends have sad expressions, otaku (it's suffocating because they start talking very passionately about things she hasn't heard of), winter"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Toshiki's childhood friend and first love. She is a famous romance novelist under the penname Ayasaka Sakura. She had won numerous awards as a novelist before enrolling at Saika Private Academy."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has a very straightforward and hardworking personality, and has the most common sense amongst the girls. Due to this she often plays the role of tsukkomi. Although she is quite knowledgeable due to her career, she doesn't know a lot about otaku stuff. As such, she is often confused whenever Toshiki and the other girls start talking about games or otaku stuff."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98081"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"寿季の幼馴染にして、初恋相手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才華学園入学前に小説家として数々の賞を取り、恋愛小説の作家として、一般人でも知るような知名度を誇る有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は真面目で素直。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あくがないしっかり者で主要登場人物の中では最も常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため突っ込み役に回ることが多い苦労人気質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロの作家として確かな実力と知識を持っているものの、一方でオタクコンテンツには疎く、主人公や他ヒロイン達の会話に「？」マークをつけながら首を傾げ、全く違う解釈をしてしまうこともしばしば。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"23514","sourceWorkId":"31106","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"寿季の幼馴染にして、初恋相手。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"才華学園入学前に小説家として数々の賞を取り、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛小説の作家として、一般人でも知るような知名度を誇る有名人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は真面目で素直。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"あくがないしっかり者で主要登場人物の中では最も常識人。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そのため突っ込み役に回ることが多い苦労人気質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"プロの作家として確かな実力と知識を持っているものの、一方でオタクコンテンツには疎く、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公や他ヒロイン達の会話に「？」マークをつけながら首を傾げ、全く違う解釈をしてしまうこともしばしば。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97677"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"好きなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97677","value":"ハッピーエンドで終わる物語、アイスクリーム、野球"},{"label":"嫌いなもの","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97677","value":"バッドエンドで終わる物語、親しい人の暗い表情、オタク（聞いてもないことを暑苦しく語りだすから）、冬"},{"label":"趣味","source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"97677","value":"プロ野球観戦"}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/7c/7cbc326016db66b743a244f4ad2e499722e1f4282fe38cedf63a03d8d7d385aa.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/1d/1de1b133c362a081bd371ea23edefd1908e4f56934a2932bd15a3d203d50ca78.web