am, hot things (has a sensitive tongue), cockroa... (can't say it)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Toshiki's cousin and Yumemi's older sister. She runs the bookstore, Nagima Bookstore, which she inherited from her late grandfather. Although she is a firm woman, she is also quite airheaded."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98133"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ad/ad44e459995a869951fe23ff8476237c0de9913153c7a2f4af5c18d78fd03427.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b7/b73fa458f5221eca63427ad06cc0601fb3b9f5a002ada565a92e45711f0e996e.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遠野 そよぎ","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:87810","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c98134","characterName":"羽衣石 姫子","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c98134"},"originalCharacterName":"羽衣石 姫子","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1221"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"B"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"152"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Playing mahjong"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Ramen (not the instant kind), smoking, gothic lolita fashion, hopeful young creators with dreams"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: Negative humans, formal situations (such as company meetings or gatherings), payment due dates"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Toshiki's class's teacher. She mainly works as a novelist, as a screenwriter, and as a scenario writer for video games. Despite her blunt personality, she is popular with her students, and they often come to ask her for advice or help."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"For some reason, she's always dressed up in gothic lolita clothing."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She has another pen name as \"Haneishi Osamu (羽石 修)\" for writing light novels."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98134"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/01/017b67fc9e854a38bb3e2a56e3c08bd168666d48c68faba439d32e624204bfca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ef/ef6ae362066abb89d5892955f3dc136876062caea0a94c6216a4805608370b34.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"小鳥居 夕花","creatorId":"vndb:s979","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s979","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s979","name":"高森 奈津美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:87812","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c98135","characterName":"花咲 芽衣","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c98135"},"originalCharacterName":"花咲 芽衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"924"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"o"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"F"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"148"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hobbies: Playing games (especially otomege and BL games)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Likes: Kiriha, otome games"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Dislikes: The word \"marriage\", her height (has a complex about it)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Kiriha's manager who works at the Rain Tears agency. She has an innocent and pure nature, and as such gets often deceived or tricked by people."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She often says she wants a boyfriend, but she has a hard time getting one because she keeps comparing them to otome game characters... to the point where even Kiriha thinks that her expectations are too high."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on the official website"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c98135"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c9/c9cdb4b598efda0ce240da2519a5e18b09bc819ae3212fa68adb4d64908755f9.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/07/075f9394ff422d309c38d55240f24b8c5fb29def8402505f94e8c5474fec2693.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"恋羽 もこ","creatorId":"vndb:s11904","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s11904","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s11904","name":"山田 奈都美","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:87815","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c98136","characterName":"雪妃 エリカ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c98136"},"originalCharacterName":"雪妃 エリカ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"118"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"cupSize":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"D"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"167"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"